# Desktop: pattern Boxes, wallpaper winlogo.bmp (tab lands on the checked Tile), OK: the desktop shows
# the tiled wallpaper. Same keys as arch311-ref/scn/desktop-pattern.scn.
# Run: ARCH311_REF=<rig> ARCH311_REF_INI=1 tools/run-cp-test.sh apps/control/tests/desktop-pattern.w16 OUT Desktop
# The rig caught no frame between the opened dialog and the wallpaper field (so 02-boxes has none);
# pointer and blink sample left out, and after OK only the desktop around the Control Panel.
# regress: ARCH311_REF_INI=1 sh tools/run-cp-test.sh "$TEST" "$OUT" Desktop
# compare: desk-pattern/02.png 01-desktop.png active ignore 320 240 332 260 ignore 338 334 350 354
# compare: desk-pattern/03.png 03-wallpaper.png active ignore 320 240 332 260 ignore 338 334 350 354
# compare: desk-pattern/04.png 04-winlogo.png active ignore 320 240 332 260 ignore 338 334 350 354
# compare: desk-pattern/05.png 05-tile.png active ignore 320 240 332 260 ignore 338 334 350 354
# compare: desk-pattern/06.png 06-ok.png 0 240 640 480 ignore 320 240 332 260
# compare: desk-pattern/06.png 06-ok.png 430 0 640 240
# ini: WIN.INI windows CoolSwitch=1
# ini: WIN.INI Desktop Pattern=127 65 65 65 65 65 127 0
# ini: WIN.INI Desktop Wallpaper=winlogo.bmp
# ini: WIN.INI Desktop IconSpacing=75
# ini: WIN.INI Desktop TileWallPaper=1
# ini: SYSTEM.INI boot SCRNSAVE.EXE=(None)
sleep 600
shot shots/01-desktop.png
key down
key down
sleep 200
shot shots/02-boxes.png
key tab
key tab
key tab
key tab
key tab
sleep 200
shotcaret shots/03-wallpaper.png
key down
key down
key down
key down
key down
key down
key down
key down
key down
key down
key down
sleep 200
shotcaret shots/04-winlogo.png
key tab
sleep 200
shot shots/05-tile.png
key space
key enter
sleep 800
shot shots/06-ok.png
quit
